{"2797960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Confidential Killings - A Detective Game", "steam_appid": 2797960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/be55f4eea797c732aacde79351254c1d.poster.avif?t=1780189664\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/be55f4eea797c732aacde79351254c1d.webm?t=1780189664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GRITTY, MATURE STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actors, writers, producers, are getting murdered one by one in cold blood. No one is safe. Who is pulling the strings behind these apparently unrelated murders?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/74eb70a539a2432fcd114366a0cb8113.poster.avif?t=1780189664\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/74eb70a539a2432fcd114366a0cb8113.webm?t=1780189664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A VARIED AND REALISTIC CAST </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Double-dealing, backstabbing, betrayal. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing is what it seems in the world of stars. Take a peek behind the curtains, learn what's going on behind the glistering façade. Meet a varied cast of characters, discover their secrets and ambitions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful... they may end up in a body bag.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/ba754bacb46c96faaba9492473dab15d.poster.avif?t=1780189664\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/ba754bacb46c96faaba9492473dab15d.webm?t=1780189664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEDUCTIVE GAMEPLAY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine the crime scene, find clues, piece together what happened, find the culprit! Reveal what's the true reason behind these <strong>Confidential Killings</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/1a4f578a6ebd4ac559d3bf9653d89b64.poster.avif?t=1780189664\" width=616 height=298 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/1a4f578a6ebd4ac559d3bf9653d89b64.webm?t=1780189664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/1a4f578a6ebd4ac559d3bf9653d89b64.mp4?t=1780189664\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/be55f4eea797c732aacde79351254c1d.poster.avif?t=1780189664\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797960/extras/be55f4eea797c732aacde79351254c1d.webm?t=1780189664\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GRITTY, MATURE STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ac